l":"https://api.github.com/users/OGNodeFather/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OGNodeFather/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OGNodeFather/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OGNodeFather/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OGNodeFather/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OGNodeFather/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/x-debian-package","state":"uploaded","size":65220720,"digest":"sha256:f90e7104d6308d491c9cfdb691672302b17b3364c3b355962479adc46da3d903","download_count":10,"created_at":"2026-09-23T16:06:34Z","updated_at":"2026-09-23T16:06:39Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/Secret3dev/SecretNetwork/releases/download/v1.27.2/secretnetwork_1.27.2_MAINNET_goleveldb_amd64_ubuntu-24.04.deb"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Secret3dev/SecretNetwork/releases/assets/584116664","id":584116664,"node_id":"RA_kwDOT-DqK84i0Om4","name":"secretnetwork_1.27.2_TRINITY_goleveldb_amd64_ubuntu-22.04.deb","label":"","uploader":{"login":"OGNodeFather","id":204282611,"node_id":"U_kgDODC0a8w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204282611?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/OGNodeFather","html_url":"https://github.com/OGNodeFather","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OGNodeFather/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OGNodeFather/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OGNodeFather/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OGNodeFather/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OGNodeFather/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OGNodeFather/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OGNodeFather/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OGNodeFather/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OGNodeFather/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/x-debian-package","state":"uploaded","size":65208616,"digest":"sha256:5ce31f1be3350b8d5d8757eec8c068adfc1b2e34c9aeaf6d8a3ff1eb9e252a1a","download_count":1,"created_at":"2026-09-23T16:06:34Z","updated_at":"2026-09-23T16:06:39Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/Secret3dev/SecretNetwork/releases/download/v1.27.2/secretnetwork_1.27.2_TRINITY_goleveldb_amd64_ubuntu-22.04.deb"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Secret3dev/SecretNetwork/releases/assets/584116661","id":584116661,"node_id":"RA_kwDOT-DqK84i0Om1","name":"secretnetwork_1.27.2_TRINITY_goleveldb_amd64_ubuntu-24.04.deb","label":"","uploader":{"login":"OGNodeFather","id":204282611,"node_id":"U_kgDODC0a8w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204282611?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/OGNodeFather","html_url":"https://github.com/OGNodeFather","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OGNodeFather/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OGNodeFather/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OGNodeFather/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OGNodeFather/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OGNodeFather/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OGNodeFather/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OGNodeFather/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OGNodeFather/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OGNodeFather/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/x-debian-package","state":"uploaded","size":65220700,"digest":"sha256:de19050e32b7704b463876fa085289ca05c26fcdcb60711d8ef0249d78b05eeb","download_count":2,"created_at":"2026-09-23T16:06:34Z","updated_at":"2026-09-23T16:06:39Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/Secret3dev/SecretNetwork/releases/download/v1.27.2/secretnetwork_1.27.2_TRINITY_goleveldb_amd64_ubuntu-24.04.deb"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Secret3dev/SecretNetwork/tarball/v1.27.2","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Secret3dev/SecretNetwork/zipball/v1.27.2","body":"Chain `secret-4` is already on 1.27.2. Pick the package that matches the machine's Ubuntu version.\n\n## Node that already has the seed\n\n`dpkg` replaces `/etc/systemd/system/secret-node.service`. This puts the current unit back, then restarts.\n\n```bash\n. /etc/os-release\ncase \"$VERSION_ID\" in\n  22.04|24.04) ;;\n  *) echo \"Ubuntu 22.04 or 24.04\"; exit 1 ;;\nesac\n\ndeb=\"secretnetwork_1.27.2_MAINNET_goleveldb_amd64_ubuntu-${VERSION_ID}.deb\"\ncurl -fL -o \"/tmp/$deb\" \\\n  \"https://github.com/Secret3dev/SecretNetwork/releases/download/v1.27.2/$deb\"\ncase \"$VERSION_ID\" in\n  22.04) echo \"ffcca0fe04422228ae92b0bb216808a0eafa1030a7073d1bf1ca347a0781fcbb  /tmp/$deb\" ;;\n  24.04) echo \"f90e7104d6308d491c9cfdb691672302b17b3364c3b355962479adc46da3d903  /tmp/$deb\" ;;\nesac | sha256sum -c -\n\nsudo cp -a /etc/systemd/system/secret-node.service /tmp/secret-node.service.bak\nsudo dpkg -i \"/tmp/$deb\"\nsudo cp -a /tmp/secret-node.service.bak /etc/systemd/system/secret-node.service\nsudo systemctl daemon-reload\nsudo systemctl restart secret-node\nsecretd version\n```\n\n`secretd version` should print `1.27.2`.\n\n## New machine\n\nSame package. `secretd auto-register` does not work. A machine that is not on the hardware allowlist cannot register. The node home has to be chain `secret-4` before start, with the network genesis and persistent peers already in `~/.secretd`.\n\n```bash\n. /etc/os-release\ncase \"$VERSION_ID\" in\n  22.04|24.04) ;;\n  *) echo \"Ubuntu 22.04 or 24.04\"; exit 1 ;;\nesac\n\ndeb=\"secretnetwork_1.27.2_MAINNET_goleveldb_amd64_ubuntu-${VERSION_ID}.deb\"\ncurl -fL -o \"/tmp/$deb\" \\\n  \"https://github.com/Secret3dev/SecretNetwork/releases/download/v1.27.2/$deb\"\nsudo dpkg -i \"/tmp/$deb\"\n\nsecretd init-enclave\nsecretd tx register auth /opt/secret/.sgx_secrets/attestation_combined.bin \\\n  --from KEY --chain-id secret-4 \\\n  --node https://rpc.secret.mainnet.secret3.dev\n\nsecretd query register secret-network-params \\\n  --node https://rpc.secret.mainnet.secret3.dev\nNODE_ID=$(secretd dump /opt/secret/.sgx_secrets/pubkey.bin)\nSEED=$(secretd query register seed \"$NODE_ID\" \\\n  --node https://rpc.secret.mainnet.secret3.dev | sed 's/^0x//')\nsecretd configure-secret node-master-key.txt \"$SEED\"\nsudo systemctl enable --now secret-node\n```\n\n`secret-network-params` writes `node-master-key.txt` in the current directory. Run `configure-secret` from that directory, after the register transaction is in a block.\n\n## Testnet\n\nChain `trinity-b`. Use the `TRINITY` package for the same Ubuntu version. Same install and register steps, with that filename and `--chain-id trinity-b`.\n\n```bash\ndeb=\"secretnetwork_1.27.2_TRINITY_goleveldb_amd64_ubuntu-${VERSION_ID}.deb\"\ncurl -fL -o \"/tmp/$deb\" \\\n  \"https://github.com/Secret3dev/SecretNetwork/releases/download/v1.27.2/$deb\"\n```\n\n22.04 sha256 `5ce31f1be3350b8d5d8757eec8c068adfc1b2e34c9aeaf6d8a3ff1eb9e252a1a`. 24.04 sha256 `de19050e32b7704b463876fa085289ca05c26fcdcb60711d8ef0249d78b05eeb`.\n"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Secret3dev/SecretNetwork/releases/373424695","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Secret3dev/SecretNetwork/releases/373424695/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/Secret3dev/SecretNetwork/releases/373424695/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/Secret3dev/SecretNetwork/releases/tag/v1.26.0-community-continuance","id":373424695,"author":{"login":"OGNodeFather","id":204282611,"node_id":"U_kgDODC0a8w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204282611?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/OGNodeFather","html_url":"https://git