.deb"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Secret3dev/SecretNetwork/releases/assets/521523024","id":521523024,"node_id":"RA_kwDOT-DqK84fFc9Q","name":"secretnetwork_1.26.0_TESTNET_goleveldb_amd64_ubuntu-24.04.deb","label":"","uploader":{"login":"OGNodeFather","id":204282611,"node_id":"U_kgDODC0a8w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204282611?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/OGNodeFather","html_url":"https://github.com/OGNodeFather","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OGNodeFather/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OGNodeFather/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OGNodeFather/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OGNodeFather/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OGNodeFather/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OGNodeFather/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OGNodeFather/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OGNodeFather/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OGNodeFather/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/x-debian-package","state":"uploaded","size":65278174,"digest":"sha256:d86def55a3c38c7de3dd91583bc66c29e05962e039e0b2ae47939b5f04faf925","download_count":4,"created_at":"2026-08-20T00:35:36Z","updated_at":"2026-08-20T00:35:43Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/Secret3dev/SecretNetwork/releases/download/v1.26.0-community-continuance/secretnetwork_1.26.0_TESTNET_goleveldb_amd64_ubuntu-24.04.deb"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Secret3dev/SecretNetwork/tarball/v1.26.0-community-continuance","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Secret3dev/SecretNetwork/zipball/v1.26.0-community-continuance","body":"## Install (all validators)\n\nOne script: detects **chain-id** (`pulsar-3` → TESTNET package, `secret-4` → MAINNET package)\nand **Ubuntu** (22.04 / 24.04), downloads the matching asset from this Release, verifies\nsha256, restarts `secret-node`.\n\n```bash\ncurl -fsSL -o install.sh \\\n  https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Secret3dev/SecretNetwork/v1.26.0-community-continuance/scripts/install-continuance.sh\nchmod +x install.sh\nsudo ./install.sh\n```\n\nThe script refuses a TESTNET package on `secret-4` and a MAINNET package on `pulsar-3`.\nDo **not** use `--unsafe-skip-upgrades`. Enclave is unchanged (MRENCLAVE `2b9a69d6…a80d`).\n\n## Packages\n\n| File | SHA-256 |\n|------|---------|\n| `secretnetwork_1.26.0_TESTNET_goleveldb_amd64_ubuntu-22.04.deb` | `672dd49b5b95587559e998f89e260142a4bcdb958a5f3009ece50e8ff4ce06d4` |\n| `secretnetwork_1.26.0_TESTNET_goleveldb_amd64_ubuntu-24.04.deb` | `d86def55a3c38c7de3dd91583bc66c29e05962e039e0b2ae47939b5f04faf925` |\n| `secretnetwork_1.26.0_MAINNET_goleveldb_amd64_ubuntu-22.04.deb` | `bb9baf0ee8d32b7800845771de1224edb42876245f1ae730323481353600a6f6` |\n| `secretnetwork_1.26.0_MAINNET_goleveldb_amd64_ubuntu-24.04.deb` | `b38ebe3dfc54e236519751fe23962edd25eb2d3ba9bfbd6eab86ad3315534a8b` |\n"}]